ATTACHMENTS — the foreign fixtures in `tests/fixtures/attachments/`, and what
readers that did not write them say.

Producers on this box: libqpdf 12.3.2 (through pikepdf 10.9.1), MuPDF 1.28.2 (through PyMuPDF 1.28.2), pypdf 6.14.2.
Readers used to judge them: the same three, plus poppler's `pdfdetach` pdfdetach version 26.10.0 (the `qpdf` and `mutool` binaries are not installed here, so the census is four readers, not five).

Each `sha256=` is the payload the fixture was built to carry; a reader that lists a
name whose hash differs found the entry but not its bytes, which is the failure this
repo calls a blank page with a page count.

== annot-only.pdf
   shape    attachment reachable only through a page /FileAttachment
   producer libqpdf 12.3.2 (pikepdf)
   MuPDF    nothing
   pypdf    nothing
   poppler  annot-only.bin
   expected annot-only.bin sha256=7ba3aad285a9

== catalog-and-annot.pdf
   shape    one FileSpec named twice: /EmbeddedFiles and page /Annots
   producer libqpdf 12.3.2 (pikepdf)
   MuPDF    catalog-and-annot.bin sha256=65f54195401c = expected
   pypdf    catalog-and-annot.bin sha256=65f54195401c = expected
   poppler  catalog-and-annot.bin, catalog-and-annot.bin
   expected catalog-and-annot.bin sha256=65f54195401c

